uluscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRfVqbG3vioMQNW67PkWS1x6_XHW0hz8H3-bQNsObFalA&oe=6B0C5DD8"}, {"file_name": "BatterUpAnywhere_Screenshot_05_2560x1440.png", "id": "1633791781882300", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624851_1633791788548966_6425744268025917700_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fNzlGsaeIbgQ7kNvwF3OwIB&_nc_oc=AdrG-wI6pbryTwo6gweXRYHioClbu39jkcBMarrGKNjkptiprRkJr79anFe6Jcc2Ni8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQn3DPhUnGiN5vqn_GBUAjmVWSsZywvSzh-9ZvhmerWtw&oe=6B0C5AD8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Batter Up, Anywhere!", "keywords": ["baseball", "batting", "battingcage", "fastball", "sports"], "long_description": "Batter Up, Anywhere! brings the fun of the batting cages to your home in a single-player game built for Meta Quest. Put on your headset, step into a virtual ballpark, and enjoy batting at your own pace.\n\nFind your rhythm at a comfortable pitch speed, or test your reactions against fastballs at 160 km/h (about 100 mph) and beyond. Face a variety of breaking pitches, practice against a single pitch type, or mix several types for a more varied challenge. Read the speed and movement, then swing.\n\nChoose a right- or left-handed batting stance, pick up the bat with your controllers, and swing with one or two hands. Watch the pitcher's delivery and time your swing.\n\nYour swing speed, contact point, and timing affect each hit. Find the sweet spot and aim to drive the ball farther.\n\nCheck your hit distance on the stadium scoreboard, change the pitch settings, and keep coming back for another challenge.\n\nBefore playing, clear enough space around you to swing your arms and controllers safely.", "short_description": "Bring the fun of the batting cages home! Choose your pitch speed and face a variety of breaking pitches or blazing fastballs at 160 km/h (about 100 mph) and beyond. Grip the bat with both 